{"seq":1,"slug":"protocol-oriented-programming","title":"面向协议编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/protocols/protocol-oriented-programming","wordCount":980,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"面向协议编程\">面向协议编程</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>面向协议编程（Protocol-Oriented Programming, POP）是 Swift 的核心编程范式。在 2015 年 WWDC 上，Apple 明确提出&quot;Swift 是一门面向协议的语言&quot;。POP 用协议组合替代类继承，通过协议扩展提供默认实现，以值类型配合协议达到多态效果，避免了传统面向对象编程中的深层继承链和脆弱基类问题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    POP[&quot;面向协议编程 POP&quot;] --&gt; COMP[&quot;协议组合&quot;]&#10;    POP --&gt; PE[&quot;协议扩展&quot;]&#10;    POP --&gt; RC[&quot;追溯遵循&quot;]&#10;    POP --&gt; VT[&quot;值类型多态&quot;]&#10;    subgraph &quot;对比&quot;&#10;        OOP[&quot;类继承 OOP&quot;]&#10;        OOP --&gt; SI[&quot;单继承限制&quot;]&#10;        OOP --&gt; FB[&quot;脆弱基类问题&quot;]&#10;        OOP --&gt; RS[&quot;引用语义&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    POP[\"面向协议编程 POP\"] --&gt; COMP[\"协议组合\"]\n    POP --&gt; PE[\"协议扩展\"]\n    POP --&gt; RC[\"追溯遵循\"]\n    POP --&gt; VT[\"值类型多态\"]\n    subgraph \"对比\"\n        OOP[\"类继承 OOP\"]\n        OOP --&gt; SI[\"单继承限制\"]\n        OOP --&gt; FB[\"脆弱基类问题\"]\n        OOP --&gt; RS[\"引用语义\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>面向协议编程（POP）的核心主张是：<strong>用协议组合替代类继承</strong>。它把「共享什么能力」和「类型是什么」解耦——类型通过遵循一组小协议来声明自己具备哪些能力，而不是通过继承一条基类链来获得实现。围绕这一主张有几个关键概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>协议组合</strong>——用 <code>&amp;</code> 把多个小协议拼成所需的类型约束，遵循「小协议、大组合」原则；</li>\n<li><strong>协议扩展</strong>——为协议提供默认实现，使遵循类型无需重复样板代码（详见「协议扩展」一篇）；</li>\n<li><strong>追溯遵循（Retroactive Conformance）</strong>——通过扩展让已有类型遵循新协议，无需修改源码；</li>\n<li><strong>值类型多态</strong>——struct/enum 配合协议达成多态，既保留值语义又避免深层继承；</li>\n<li><strong>协议 vs 类继承</strong>——继承适合引用语义与身份标识，协议适合行为契约与解耦。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>正是这些机制的组合，使 POP 规避了传统 OOP 的单继承限制、脆弱基类与高耦合问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"协议-vs-类继承\">协议 vs 类继承</h2><p>传统面向对象使用类继承实现代码复用和多态，但存在诸多局限：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>类继承</th>\n<th>协议组合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>继承层级</td>\n<td>单继承（树形）</td>\n<td>多协议遵循（扁平）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用类型</td>\n<td>仅 class</td>\n<td>struct、enum、class、actor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义</td>\n<td>引用语义</td>\n<td>值语义 + 引用语义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码复用</td>\n<td>继承父类实现</td>\n<td>协议扩展提供默认实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>耦合度</td>\n<td>高（子类依赖父类细节）</td>\n<td>低（仅依赖协议契约）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展性</td>\n<td>需要修改继承链</td>\n<td>追溯遵循，无需修改源码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"protocol Flyable {&#10;    var maxAltitude: Double { get }&#10;    func fly()&#10;}&#10;&#10;protocol Swimmable {&#10;    var maxDepth: Double { get }&#10;    func swim()&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct Duck: Flyable, Swimmable {&#10;    var maxAltitude: Double { 1000 }&#10;    var maxDepth: Double { 5 }&#10;    func fly() { print(&quot;Duck flying&quot;) }&#10;    func swim() { print(&quot;Duck swimming&quot;) }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Flyable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxAltitude: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fly</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Swimmable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxDepth: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> swim</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Duck</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Flyable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Swimmable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxAltitude: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxDepth: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fly</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Duck flying\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> swim</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Duck swimming\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"协议组合\">协议组合</h2><p>Swift 允许一个类型同时遵循多个协议，并且可以使用 <code>&amp;</code> 运算符组合协议作为类型约束：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"protocol Identifiable {&#10;    var id: String { get }&#10;}&#10;&#10;protocol Displayable {&#10;    var displayName: String { get }&#10;}&#10;&#10;protocol Persistable {&#10;    func save() throws&#10;}&#10;&#10;func show(_ item: some Identifiable &amp; Displayable) {&#10;    print(&quot;\\(item.id): \\(item.displayName)&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;typealias FullEntity = Identifiable &amp; Displayable &amp; Persistable\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Identifiable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Displayable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> displayName: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Persistable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> save</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throws</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> show</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Identifiable </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Displayable) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\\(item.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">id</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\\(item.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">displayName</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">typealias</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FullEntity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Identifiable </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Displayable </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Persistable</span></span></code></pre></div><p>协议组合的设计哲学是<strong>小协议、大组合</strong>——每个协议只定义一个最小的能力集合，通过组合满足不同场景的需求。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"追溯遵循-retroactive-conformance\">追溯遵循（Retroactive Conformance）</h2><p>追溯遵循允许在不修改原始类型源码的情况下，通过扩展使其遵循新协议：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"protocol Summable {&#10;    static func +(lhs: Self, rhs: Self) -&gt; Self&#10;}&#10;&#10;extension Int: Summable {}&#10;extension Double: Summable {}&#10;extension String: Summable {}&#10;&#10;func sumAll&lt;T: Summable&gt;(_ values: [T]) -&gt; T? {&#10;    guard let first = values.first else { return nil }&#10;    return values.dropFirst().reduce(first, +)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Summable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">lhs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rhs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Self</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">extension</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Summable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">extension</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Summable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">extension</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Summable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sumAll</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Summable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> values: [T]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    guard</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> first </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> values.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">first</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> values.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dropFirst</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(first, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这是 POP 的杀手级特性——即使是标准库或第三方库的类型，也可以通过追溯遵循融入你的协议体系。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 追溯遵循应遵守&quot;所有权规则&quot;：只有协议的定义者或类型的定义者才应该添加遵循。在两者都不属于你的情况下添加追溯遵循可能导致冲突。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"pop-设计模式\">POP 设计模式</h2><h3 id=\"能力组合模式\">能力组合模式</h3><p>将不同的能力拆分为独立协议，按需组合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"protocol Cacheable {&#10;    var cacheKey: String { get }&#10;    var cacheExpiry: TimeInterval { get }&#10;}&#10;&#10;protocol Loggable {&#10;    var logDescription: String { get }&#10;}&#10;&#10;protocol Validatable {&#10;    func validate() throws&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct UserProfile: Cacheable, Loggable, Validatable {&#10;    let name: String&#10;    let email: String&#10;&#10;    var cacheKey: String { &quot;user_\\(email)&quot; }&#10;    var cacheExpiry: TimeInterval { 3600 }&#10;    var logDescription: String { &quot;UserProfile(\\(name))&quot; }&#10;&#10;    func validate() throws {&#10;        guard email.contains(&quot;@&quot;) else {&#10;            throw ValidationError.invalidEmail&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Cacheable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cacheKey: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cacheExpiry: TimeInterval { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\">